{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Dess — Where Is She?\n\nNoelle's older sister. Missing since before the game. Never appears on screen through Ch.5 inclusive.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nSilhouette consistent with Dess; appears in exactly the chapters that matter most to the Holiday family.","x":-130,"y":-502,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**The Lake (Ch.5)**\nAn almost decorative location until Ch.5, where it's revealed as a loose thread leading directly into Ch.7.","x":327,"y":-203,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nYounger sister; her father Rudy hasn't gotten over the loss — the emotional engine of her chapters.","x":152,"y":279,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Shelter**\nPossible site of the incident that caused her disappearance.","x":-412,"y":279,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Man**\nMinority reading: her disappearance could be behind a repressed trauma of Kris's.","x":-587,"y":-203,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/dess_knight1.png","x":-130,"y":-907,"width":260,"height":146},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lake.png","x":685,"y":-356,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":404,"y":539,"width":95,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shelter.png","x":-664,"y":539,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":-678,"y":-502,"width":221,"height":190},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-709,"y":30,"width":91,"height":190},{"id":"s_asriel","type":"text","x":700,"y":300,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1","text":"**Asriel** The \"ICEE\" cryptid sighting (Noelle's blog, 2022) shows them together as children — the most direct clue that they spent time together before her disappearance."},{"id":"s_lostgirl","type":"text","x":-130,"y":650,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"**\"Lost Girl\" / \"Find Her\"** Toby Fox clarified that the theme isn't only Noelle's; the 2022 ARG directly links it to Dess's guitar via the file \"findher.ogg\"."},{"id":"s_asriel-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel.png","x":700,"y":90,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s_unused","type":"text","text":"**The hidden \"UNUSED\" text**\nA voice trapped in total darkness, losing its sense of time and clinging to its own memories to keep from disappearing — expanded on in every chapter. A Wingdings comment next to the code confirms it's Dess.","x":-350,"y":-1250,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_unused-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/dess_unused_text_code_cap5.webp","x":-350,"y":-1520,"width":220,"height":190},{"id":"s_roots","type":"text","text":"**🎲 Did she get lost in the forest following \"the tail\"?**\nThe ROOTS room (Ch.4) talks about children lost in the forest following \"the tail\" — FRIEND is the most-cited candidate for that \"tail from hell\". Not confirmed that Dess is one of those girls.","x":700,"y":-950,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"1"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_asriel","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_asriel","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_lostgirl","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_lostgirl","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_asriel-img","fromNode":"s_asriel-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_asriel","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_unused","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_unused","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_unused-img","fromNode":"s_unused-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_unused","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_roots","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_roots","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_knight_shelter","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_knight_lake","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_lostgirl_lake","fromNode":"s_lostgirl","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_unused_shelter","fromNode":"s_unused","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_roots_forgottenman","fromNode":"s_roots","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s4","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_noelle_asriel","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_asriel","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_lostgirl_unused","fromNode":"s_lostgirl","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_unused","toSide":"left","color":"3"}]}